      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is a mismatch here. fConics.size_bytes() only moves the pointer by ncns * 4 (since it\u0027s a float array), but the accumulator back in the buffer allocation step reserved ncns * 8 (via sizeof(SkPoint)). This means fVerbs is being placed inside the second half of the pre-allocated conic buffer, not after it.",
